Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.18,0:22:10.60,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你說是吧 翼
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.58,0:22:16.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.16,0:22:18.52,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,馬上就春天了
